{"repo": {"name": {"en-US": "train-libre F-Droid Repo"}, "description": {"en-US": "Automated F-Droid repository for train-libre"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/icons/icon.png", "sha256": "e0809c6a3aaa0bf8d544c1941196b5065fa044a62d3b2d12d47b4d773d72fb5e", "size": 818}}, "address": "https://rfivesix.github.io/train-libre/fdroid/repo", "timestamp": 1781479191000, "categories": {"Sports & Health": {"name": {"en-US": "Sports & Health"}}}}, "packages": {"com.rfivesix.trainlibre": {"metadata": {"added": 1781479184000, "categories": ["Sports & Health"], "issueTracker": "https://github.com/rfivesix/train-libre/issues", "lastUpdated": 1781479185000, "license": "GPL-3.0-or-later", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/rfivesix/train-libre", "webSite": "https://github.com/rfivesix/train-libre", "screenshots": {"phone": {"de-DE": [{"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/01.png", "sha256": "01b7c69a528a0a261d8ed8539c46c3de1cd76693fd9edea71869b16fa35e977a", "size": 381472}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/02.png", "sha256": "10a9fdb9cdee4a07b2d0114ed8f956ded193a5860072c52cfafb7b9808317594", "size": 332110}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/03.png", "sha256": "8e3e11df5c54128b76ff52ff88cfa4bffbfff378f14fdc33c03dd07e9ac7a90b", "size": 249455}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/04.png", "sha256": "8dbba6a064d2903f5006798fb74072df022a1721e35a27a5818ffb250f58556c", "size": 190981}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/05.png", "sha256": "db806db1866130cdb79892c3b4331bd93ba3d724f1f82a6eb06354e099a03e9c", "size": 226071}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/06.png", "sha256": "4c7f0d85bfe432f58c20583ff7b7b0447874b5a01793fa1b30be37de101a60fb", "size": 715694}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/07.png", "sha256": "727d8f4f2cc806219d611128542db02e0eed164f12f94885707a3a0caca73c20", "size": 224404}], "en-US": [{"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/01.png", "sha256": "d5e00109ecaf595d9c09de9529eb7003e47d30677d37df325486e6515a36dd5d", "size": 374402}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/02.png", "sha256": "729ce71cd49b9cd9f4855844d1a06dd7ef97e84bfaa4dd288d16304d9702fb76", "size": 309593}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/03.png", "sha256": "f4353d91362c5bb2c7275f0bbf0eae9d5fa0cc902eacad12625bc98a3f3f41d9", "size": 229988}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/04.png", "sha256": "f0db7dc25507754e6070cba49b8054fc144789d154e7b84b56a3e13115ef4789", "size": 190665}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/05.png", "sha256": "4b1474c0e6b0f14d7bc44d628d7e886349d8233b9040e2b05c7e501ac2b33d14", "size": 229899}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/06.png", "sha256": "c06545b4178f63d5f75fcdbd7938397a230113b01418fa7131ad21b4629cf6d1", "size": 708648}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/07.png", "sha256": "f41b3b97b02ff583a22ae9dd25c65251e6feb33c795ffe2e6659985e26d664ea", "size": 205043}]}}, "name": {"en-US": "Train Libre", "de-DE": "Train Libre"}, "summary": {"en-US": "Open-source workout and nutrition tracker with local-first data.", "de-DE": "Open-Source Tracker für Training und Ernährung mit lokalen Daten."}, "description": {"en-US": "Train Libre is an open-source, offline-first fitness tracker for people who want serious training and nutrition logging without giving up control of their data.\n\nFeatures:\n- Log workouts set by set, including warm-ups, working sets, failure sets, dropsets, reps, weight, and RIR\n- Build reusable routines and review completed sessions\n- Track nutrition, meals, hydration, caffeine, creatine, supplements, bodyweight, and body measurements\n- Use progress statistics for PRs, consistency, muscle volume, recovery, body trends, calories, sleep, steps, and pulse where available\n- Keep app data local by default, with export and import for local backups\n- Use integrated Open Food Facts and wger-based catalog sources\n- Export supported app-recorded data one way to Google Health Connect\n- Use optional AI meal features with your own API key, disabled by default\n\nWhat makes Train Libre different:\n- Open source and developed in public\n- Offline-first, with no mandatory cloud account\n- Built for structured gym tracking instead of gamification\n- Transparent analytics designed to be understandable and useful over the long term\n\nTrain Libre is not a medical app. Recovery, sleep, and pulse features are intended for training guidance and personal tracking only and are not medical diagnosis or treatment.\n\nOpen Source:\nThe source code is publicly available and the app is developed in the open.\n", "de-DE": "Train Libre ist ein Open-Source Fitness-Tracker für Menschen, die Training und Ernährung ernsthaft protokollieren wollen, ohne die Kontrolle über ihre Daten abzugeben.\n\nFunktionen:\n- Workouts Satz für Satz protokollieren, inklusive Aufwärmsätzen, Arbeitssätzen, Sätzen bis zum Versagen, Dropsets, Wiederholungen, Gewicht und RIR\n- Routinen erstellen, wiederverwenden und abgeschlossene Einheiten auswerten\n- Ernährung, Mahlzeiten, Hydration, Koffein, Kreatin, Supplements, Körpergewicht und Körpermaße tracken\n- Statistiken für PRs, Konsistenz, Muskelvolumen, Recovery, Körpertrends, Kalorien, Schlaf, Schritte und Puls nutzen, sofern Daten verfügbar sind\n- App-Daten standardmäßig lokal behalten, inklusive Export und Import lokaler Backups\n- Integrierte Datenquellen auf Basis von Open Food Facts und wger verwenden\n- Unterstützte selbst erfasste Daten einseitig zu Google Health Connect exportieren\n- Optionale KI-Mahlzeitenfunktionen mit eigenem API-Key nutzen, standardmäßig deaktiviert\n\nWas Train Libre besonders macht:\n- Open Source und öffentlich entwickelt\n- Offline-first, ohne verpflichtenden Cloud-Account\n- Gebaut für strukturiertes Krafttraining statt Gamification\n- Transparente Analysen, die langfristig verständlich und nützlich bleiben sollen\n\nTrain Libre ist keine medizinische App. Recovery-, Schlaf- und Pulsfunktionen dienen der Trainingsplanung und persönlichen Orientierung und stellen keine medizinische Diagnose oder Behandlung dar.\n\nOpen Source:\nDer Quellcode ist öffentlich verfügbar und die App wird offen entwickelt.\n"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/icon_BDpnPPO5DCAteR-f5uh6yr8SZKF_miQjdDozt7si38I=.png", "sha256": "043a673cf3b90c202d791f9fe6e87acabf1264a17f9a2423743a33b7bb22dfc2", "size": 13030}, "de-DE": {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/icon_BDpnPPO5DCAteR-f5uh6yr8SZKF_miQjdDozt7si38I=.png", "sha256": "043a673cf3b90c202d791f9fe6e87acabf1264a17f9a2423743a33b7bb22dfc2", "size": 13030}}, "preferredSigner": "7bea1cc437d23ad86535001c2996c22def49d8d75bd6b4942b6aad59572b17cc"}, "versions": {"8235d7d1c5eec70ee0832586157b4ebd9031bdc9ad6b206f95c4a9c3aa1667ff": {"added": 1781479185000, "file": {"name": "/app-x86_64-release.apk", "sha256": "8235d7d1c5eec70ee0832586157b4ebd9031bdc9ad6b206f95c4a9c3aa1667ff", "size": 35871508}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["x86_64"], "versionName": "0.9.30", "versionCode": 94048, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 26, "targetSdkVersion": 36}, "signer": {"sha256": ["7bea1cc437d23ad86535001c2996c22def49d8d75bd6b4942b6aad59572b17cc"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE", "maxSdkVersion": 32}, {"name": "android.permission.WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE", "maxSdkVersion": 28}, {"name": "android.permission.CAMERA"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.READ_STEPS"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.READ_SLEEP"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.READ_HEART_RATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.WRITE_WEIGHT"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.WRITE_BODY_FAT"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.WRITE_NUTRITION"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.WRITE_